      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ActionLink.tsx        One link component for call\n(tel:), whatsapp (wa.me with optional\nmessage) and directions (Google Maps).\nOpens external links in a new tab and fires a\nGA4/GTM click event if one is installed.\nHeader, Footer, Home, Contact, ProductPage,\nLocalCta, the floating WhatsApp button\n\nFaq.tsx        The 5-question accordion. It also\noutputs FAQPage JSON-LD for Google. The\nquestions are hard-coded inside the file.\nHome, ProductPage\n\nImageSlider.tsx        Autoplaying photo\ncarousel with arrows, dots and touch swipe. It\npauses on hover and respects reduced motion.\nHome hero card\n\nJsonLd.tsx        A tiny wrapper that renders a\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\"> from an\nobject.        Home, Faq, Contact, Article\n\nLocalCta.tsx        The dark “Need construction\nmaterials?” band with Call and WhatsApp\nbuttons. Title and description can be\noverridden.        Home, About, Blog, Article,\nContact, ProductPage\n\nMeta.tsx        Sets the page title, description,\ncanonical, Open Graph, Twitter and robots\ntags in the browser via useEffect. It has a\nnoindex option.        Every page\n\nPageHero.tsx        The dark title banner at the\ntop of inner pages (title, optional description,\noptional children).        About, Blog, Contact,\nLocation, ProductPage\n\nThemeToggle.tsx        The sun/moon button\nthat calls toggleTheme from lib/theme.",
      "fontSize": 18.729766271256786,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ActionLink.tsx        One link component for call (tel:), whatsapp (wa.me with optional message) and directions (Google Maps). Opens external links in a new tab and fires a GA4/GTM click event if one is installed.        Header, Footer, Home, Contact, ProductPage, LocalCta, the floating WhatsApp button\n\nFaq.tsx        The 5-question accordion. It also outputs FAQPage JSON-LD for Google. The questions are hard-coded inside the file.        Home, ProductPage\n\nImageSlider.tsx        Autoplaying photo carousel with arrows, dots and touch swipe. It pauses on hover and respects reduced motion.        Home hero card\n\nJsonLd.tsx        A tiny wrapper that renders a <script type=\"application/ld+json\"> from an object.        Home, Faq, Contact, Article\n\nLocalCta.tsx        The dark “Need construction materials?” band with Call and WhatsApp buttons. Title and description can be overridden.        Home, About, Blog, Article, Contact, ProductPage\n\nMeta.tsx        Sets the page title, description, canonical, Open Graph, Twitter and robots tags in the browser via useEffect. It has a noindex option.        Every page\n\nPageHero.tsx        The dark title banner at the top of inner pages (title, optional description, optional children).        About, Blog, Contact, Location, ProductPage\n\nThemeToggle.tsx        The sun/moon button that calls toggleTheme from lib/theme.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.15,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
