      "updated": 1791732502271,
      "created": 1791658096980,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "ContactFoam.tsx. The filename is a\ntypo, since it exports ContactForm.\nIt’s used only on the Contact page.\n\nFields\n\n-Name (required, at least 2\ncharacters).\n-Phone (required). It accepts 98765\n43210, +91 98765-43210 or 0987…\nand normalises to 10 digits starting\nwith 6-9.\n-Material required (a dropdown of 9\noptions, required).\n-Message (optional, max 1000\ncharacters).\n-A hidden honeypot field called\nwebsite. Bots fill it in, and the form\nthen pretends to succeed and drops\nthe submission.",
      "fontSize": 12.947353834462701,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ContactFoam.tsx. The filename is a typo, since it exports ContactForm. It’s used only on the Contact page.\n\nFields\n\n-Name (required, at least 2 characters).\n-Phone (required). It accepts 98765 43210, +91 98765-43210 or 0987… and normalises to 10 digits starting with 6-9.\n-Material required (a dropdown of 9 options, required).\n-Message (optional, max 1000 characters).\n-A hidden honeypot field called website. Bots fill it in, and the form then pretends to succeed and drops the submission.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.15,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
