      "updated": 1791732502271,
      "created": 1791658272379,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Header.tsx (330 lines)     \n A sticky 76px bar with the logo (which\nshrinks after 120px of scroll), desktop\nnav, Call button and theme toggle. On\nmobile it has the menu button, which\nopens a full-screen navy menu with\nnumbered links, Call, WhatsApp and a\ntheme toggle. It locks scrolling while the\nmenu is open.\n\nFooter.tsx       \n A CTA band, the company blurb with the\n“Authorized Tata Tiscon Dealer” badge,\nQuick Links, Products, Contact\n(address, phone, WhatsApp), a large\noutlined “Ramprasad” wordmark and\nthe copyright bar with Back to top.\n\nCoverIntro.tsx       \n The first screen on Home: the navy cover\nwith logo, name, tagline, three highlights\nand the photo, pinned with position:\nsticky. The rest of the page slides up over\nit, and the cover fades as you scroll. It is\nonly used by Home.",
      "fontSize": 18.36274063590075,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Header.tsx (330 lines)     \n A sticky 76px bar with the logo (which shrinks after 120px of scroll), desktop nav, Call button and theme toggle. On mobile it has the menu button, which opens a full-screen navy menu with numbered links, Call, WhatsApp and a theme toggle. It locks scrolling while the menu is open.\n\nFooter.tsx       \n A CTA band, the company blurb with the “Authorized Tata Tiscon Dealer” badge, Quick Links, Products, Contact (address, phone, WhatsApp), a large outlined “Ramprasad” wordmark and the copyright bar with Back to top.\n\nCoverIntro.tsx       \n The first screen on Home: the navy cover with logo, name, tagline, three highlights and the photo, pinned with position: sticky. The rest of the page slides up over it, and the cover fades as you scroll. It is only used by Home.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.15,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
