      "updated": 1791661579338,
      "created": 1791659550034,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "TrustStrip.tsx\n\nThe dark four-column “at a glance” strip right under the hero.\n\nMaterial categories: counts up to productDetails.length (currently 8).\nBrands to choose from: counts up to brands.length (currently 7).\nAuthorized dealer: an icon with the note “Tata Tiscon TMT bars”.\nLocal supply: an icon with “Dosinga · Dhamara · Bhadrak”.\n\nThe two numbers come from the site’s own data files, so they update on\ntheir own when you add a product or brand. It uses CountUp from the\nmotion folder, and data-reveal-group staggers the four columns in.\n\nProcess.tsx\n\nThe “05 / How it works” section with three cards.\n\nTell us what you need: call or WhatsApp with the material, quantity and\nsite location.\nWe confirm the details: current brands, grades and availability.\nPlan the supply: fix the order around the build schedule.",
      "fontSize": 22.912176452804605,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "iPzr90B4bWwm7_RrqwIL_",
      "originalText": "TrustStrip.tsx\n\nThe dark four-column “at a glance” strip right under the hero.\n\nMaterial categories: counts up to productDetails.length (currently 8).\nBrands to choose from: counts up to brands.length (currently 7).\nAuthorized dealer: an icon with the note “Tata Tiscon TMT bars”.\nLocal supply: an icon with “Dosinga · Dhamara · Bhadrak”.\n\nThe two numbers come from the site’s own data files, so they update on their own when you add a product or brand. It uses CountUp from the motion folder, and data-reveal-group staggers the four columns in.\n\nProcess.tsx\n\nThe “05 / How it works” section with three cards.\n\nTell us what you need: call or WhatsApp with the material, quantity and site location.\nWe confirm the details: current brands, grades and availability.\nPlan the supply: fix the order around the build schedule.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.15,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
