      "text": "toast.tsx       \n\n Styled building blocks for pop-up notifications, built on\n@radix-ui/react-toast: the viewport, the toast itself,\ntitle, description, close button and action button, with a\nnormal and a destructive variant.\n\ntoaster.tsx\n       \n A <Toaster /> that reads the toast list from hooks/use-\ntoast.ts and renders each one.\n\ntooltip.tsx       \n Hover tooltip components (Tooltip, TooltipTrigger,\nTooltipContent, TooltipProvider) built on @radix-\nui/react-tooltip.",
      "fontSize": 20.41113471776437,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "toast.tsx       \n\n Styled building blocks for pop-up notifications, built on @radix-ui/react-toast: the viewport, the toast itself, title, description, close button and action button, with a normal and a destructive variant.\n\ntoaster.tsx\n       \n A <Toaster /> that reads the toast list from hooks/use-toast.ts and renders each one.\n\ntooltip.tsx       \n Hover tooltip components (Tooltip, TooltipTrigger, TooltipContent, TooltipProvider) built on @radix-ui/react-tooltip.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.15,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
