    {
      "id": "zxiAPFxbxPwwh7y2y1mnv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7797.08376692535,
      "y": 6619.211495856689,
      "width": 548.4733414916385,
      "height": 149.6297425647185,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#38d9a9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3t",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 6467125,
      "version": 143,
      "versionNonce": 461803957,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791660291605,
      "created": 1791660276368,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "productDetails.ts (276 lines, the main one)\n\nIt defines a ProductDetail type and an array of 8 products: TMT steel, cement, sand, stone chips and aggregates, boulders, bricks, binding wire, and\nroofing and accessories. Each product has:\n\nslug, title, short (one-line summary for the Home catalogue), desc, types, uses, availability\nicon (actually a number string like '01', used as the row number on Home)\nrelated (slugs of other products)\nimage and gallery: Cloudinary public ids such as ramprasad/rod4, passed through cld()\nvariants with variantLabel (e.g. “Choose diameter”) and bagSizes with bagSizeLabel: the selector options on the product page\n\nIt also exports productDetailsBySlug, a lookup map used by the product page and related links.\n\nWho reads it: Home (catalogue list, marquee, hero counts), TrustStrip (the category count), ProductPage (everything), and indirectly the contact\nform prefill.",
      "fontSize": 8.674187974766294,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "productDetails.ts (276 lines, the main one)\n\nIt defines a ProductDetail type and an array of 8 products: TMT steel, cement, sand, stone chips and aggregates, boulders, bricks, binding wire, and roofing and accessories. Each product has:\n\nslug, title, short (one-line summary for the Home catalogue), desc, types, uses, availability\nicon (actually a number string like '01', used as the row number on Home)\nrelated (slugs of other products)\nimage and gallery: Cloudinary public ids such as ramprasad/rod4, passed through cld()\nvariants with variantLabel (e.g. “Choose diameter”) and bagSizes with bagSizeLabel: the selector options on the product page\n\nIt also exports productDetailsBySlug, a lookup map used by the product page and related links.\n\nWho reads it: Home (catalogue list, marquee, hero counts), TrustStrip (the category count), ProductPage (everything), and indirectly the contact form prefill.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.15,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "CUy1iMpkEIBtYVTy_n1dc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7815.078364824886,
      "y": 6887.77757588974,
      "width": 535.2219319273408,
      "height": 138,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#38d9a9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
