      "version": 120,
      "versionNonce": 639120789,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791660317538,
      "created": 1791660304878,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "brands.ts\n\nA list of 7 names: Tata Tiscon, Jindal Steel, SAIL / Odisha SAIL,\nUltraTech Cement, Jindal Cement, JSW Panther and JSW\nUltima. Used by the Home brand chips, the marquee, and the\nTrustStrip count.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "brands.ts\n\nA list of 7 names: Tata Tiscon, Jindal Steel, SAIL / Odisha SAIL, UltraTech Cement, Jindal Cement, JSW Panther and JSW Ultima. Used by the Home brand chips, the marquee, and the TrustStrip count.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.15,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Zoht6_02k__rCHxgYISgI",
