      "updated": 1791660653552,
      "created": 1791660642056,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "A global toast store. The toast list lives in a module-\nlevel variable (memoryState), not React state, with a\nlisteners array. Any component can call toast({ title,\ndescription }) from anywhere and every subscribed\nuseToast() re-renders.\nA reducer with four actions: ADD_TOAST,\nUPDATE_TOAST, DISMISS_TOAST, REMOVE_TOAST.\ntoast() creates a toast with a generated id and returns {\nid, dismiss, update }.\nuseToast() returns the current toast list plus toast and\ndismiss. <Toaster /> in App.tsx uses it to render them.\nLimits: only 1 toast is visible at a time (TOAST_LIMIT =\n1). A dismissed toast is removed after\nTOAST_REMOVE_DELAY = 1000000 ms (about 16\nminutes), a long delay copied from the shadcn template.",
      "fontSize": 15.231236343872492,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A global toast store. The toast list lives in a module-level variable (memoryState), not React state, with a listeners array. Any component can call toast({ title, description }) from anywhere and every subscribed useToast() re-renders.\nA reducer with four actions: ADD_TOAST, UPDATE_TOAST, DISMISS_TOAST, REMOVE_TOAST.\ntoast() creates a toast with a generated id and returns { id, dismiss, update }.\nuseToast() returns the current toast list plus toast and dismiss. <Toaster /> in App.tsx uses it to render them.\nLimits: only 1 toast is visible at a time (TOAST_LIMIT = 1). A dismissed toast is removed after TOAST_REMOVE_DELAY = 1000000 ms (about 16 minutes), a long delay copied from the shadcn template.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.15,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
