      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Home.tsx (538 lines) ( /)\n\n        Wrapped in CoverIntro. Sections in order: hero (headline,\nCall/WhatsApp/Directions buttons, slider card with 4 tiles), TrustStrip,\n“The difference” (Tiscon feature card plus 3 cards), product catalogue list,\nmaterials and brands marquee, brand chips, Process, LocalCta, Faq. Also the\nHardwareStore JSON-LD.\n\nProductPage.tsx (366 lines)        /products/:slug      \n  Hero, main image plus 3 gallery thumbnails, variant picker, size picker,\nquantity stepper, details rows, an “Ask for availability” link to /contact?….\nA sticky sidebar has the all-products list and an enquiry box (Call,\nWhatsApp). Then related products, Faq and LocalCta. An unknown slug\nshows NotFound.\n\nContact.tsx        /contact      \n  Hero, a details card (phone, WhatsApp, address, hours), Call and\nDirections buttons, and the ContactForm. ContactPage JSON-LD.\n\nLocation.tsx        /location      \n  Hero, a dark address panel next to an embedded Google map, directions\nand “View on Google Maps” links, a “Local relevance” section with area\nchips and a button to Contact.\n\nAbout.tsx        /about       \n Hero and a founder section (Subash Bera: photo, two paragraphs, three stat\nblocks), then LocalCta.\n\nBlog.tsx        /blog     \n   Hero and a two-column grid of the 8 articles.\n\nArticle.tsx        /blog/:slug      \n  Finds the article by slug, then shows the title, excerpt and body, with\nArticle JSON-LD and a canonical URL.\n\nNotFound.tsx        *     \n   A “404” message, a back-home button, and noindex.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 7,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Home.tsx (538 lines) ( /)\n\n        Wrapped in CoverIntro. Sections in order: hero (headline, Call/WhatsApp/Directions buttons, slider card with 4 tiles), TrustStrip, “The difference” (Tiscon feature card plus 3 cards), product catalogue list, materials and brands marquee, brand chips, Process, LocalCta, Faq. Also the HardwareStore JSON-LD.\n\nProductPage.tsx (366 lines)        /products/:slug      \n  Hero, main image plus 3 gallery thumbnails, variant picker, size picker, quantity stepper, details rows, an “Ask for availability” link to /contact?…. A sticky sidebar has the all-products list and an enquiry box (Call, WhatsApp). Then related products, Faq and LocalCta. An unknown slug shows NotFound.\n\nContact.tsx        /contact      \n  Hero, a details card (phone, WhatsApp, address, hours), Call and Directions buttons, and the ContactForm. ContactPage JSON-LD.\n\nLocation.tsx        /location      \n  Hero, a dark address panel next to an embedded Google map, directions and “View on Google Maps” links, a “Local relevance” section with area chips and a button to Contact.\n\nAbout.tsx        /about       \n Hero and a founder section (Subash Bera: photo, two paragraphs, three stat blocks), then LocalCta.\n\nBlog.tsx        /blog     \n   Hero and a two-column grid of the 8 articles.\n\nArticle.tsx        /blog/:slug      \n  Finds the article by slug, then shows the title, excerpt and body, with Article JSON-LD and a canonical URL.\n\nNotFound.tsx        *     \n   A “404” message, a back-home button, and noindex.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.15,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
